	// EXPECT-2: load_spikes_e2e_ms < 3355
	// HYPOTHESIS-3: CacheHitRate tiebreaker preserves cache_warmup performance by not activating in cold-cache scenarios (maxPrefix < 0.05 disables affinity entirely)
	// MECHANISM-3: Cold cache detection ensures CacheHitRate bonus only applies when meaningful cache exists
	// EXPECT-3: cache_warmup_e2e_ms < 4270
